        "text": "**WARP RIFTS**\n\nEach time a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army is set up on the battlefield using the Deep Strike ability, if it is set up wholly within your army’s Shadow of Chaos, and/or if it is set up wholly within 6\" of one or more friendly **BLOODTHIRSTER**, **GREAT UNCLEAN ONE**, **KAIROS FATEWEAVER**, **KEEPER OF SECRETS**, **LORD OF CHANGE**, **ROTIGUS**, **SHALAXI HELBANE** or **SKARBRAND** units with which it shares the **KHORNE**, **TZEENTCH**, **NURGLE** or **SLAANESH** keyword, it can be set up anywhere that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy models, instead of more than 8\"."
      },
