        "text": "**FIRST PRINCE OF CHAOS**\n\nIf your Army Faction is **LEGIONES DAEMONICA**, you can use this Shadow Legion Detachment rule.\n\nFirst Prince of Chaos\n\nUnits from your army have the relevant abilities presented below.\n\nMurderer’s Cowl\n\nPenumbral Puppetry\n\nGloam Rot\n\nShadow’s Caress\n\nDisciples of Be’lakor"
