        "text": "**LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH MONSTER** model only. At the end of the Fight phase, if one or more enemy models were destroyed this phase as a result of one or more of the bearer’s attacks, it can use this Enhancement. If it does, it regains up to D3 lost wounds."
