      "Stratagem§Archagonists": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Legion of Excess"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH MONSTER** unit or up to two **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** units (excluding **MONSTERS**) from your army that have not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in one of those units makes an attack, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Binding Shadow": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Shadow Legion"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to one **SHADOW LEGION HERETIC ASTARTES** unit from your army and up to one **SHADOW LEGION LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army. You can only select units that are not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove those selected units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blood Begets Skulls": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Blood Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit from your army that has not been selected to charge this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cavalcade of Blades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Legion of Excess"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, just after a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit from your army ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit, then roll one D6 for each model in your unit that is within Engagement Range of that enemy unit, or roll six D6 instead if your unit is a **MONSTER** unit: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Stratagem§Channelled Wrath": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Shadow Legion"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **SHADOW LEGION** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[LANCE]** ability. If your unit has the **KHORNE** keyword, until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of those weapons by 1 as well."
      },
      "Stratagem§Corrupt Realspace": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Daemonic Incursion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of any Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army that is within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT:** That objective marker is said to be Corrupted and remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn. In addition, while an objective marker is Corrupted and under your control, the area of the battlefield within 6\" of that objective marker is considered to be within your army’s Shadow of Chaos."
      },
      "Stratagem§Daemonic Invulnerability": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Daemonic Incursion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of that enemy unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an invulnerable saving throw is made for a model in your unit, re-roll a saving throw of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Death Denied": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Shadow Legion"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **SHADOW LEGION** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** One model in your unit regains up to 3 lost wounds. In addition, If your unit has the **TZEENTCH** keyword, return up to one destroyed model (excluding **CHARACTER** models) to your unit with its full wounds remaining."
      },
      "Stratagem§Delirium Unmade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Scintillating Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units. Alternatively, you can spend one Flux token when you use this Stratagem and target up to two **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** units from your army instead (including those within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units).\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Denizens of the Warp": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Daemonic Incursion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy models."
      },
      "Stratagem§Draught of Terror": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Daemonic Incursion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of weapons equipped by models in that unit by 1. In addition, until the end of the phase, each time such a weapon targets a unit that is Battle-shocked, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Encroaching Darkness": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Shadow Legion"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to one **SHADOW LEGION HERETIC ASTARTES** unit from your army and up to one **SHADOW LEGION LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army. You can only select units that arrived from Reserves this turn.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your selected units have the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fateborne Nightmares": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Scintillating Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a move, it can move through terrain features."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fever Visions": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Plague Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. After your unit has finished making its attacks, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks; that enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ficklefire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Scintillating Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, enemy units are not considered to be within Engagement Range of your unit for the purposes of selecting targets for, and resolving attacks with, ranged weapons. Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy model is destroyed while its unit is within Engagement Range of your unit, roll one D6: on a 5+, your unit suffers 1 mortal wound after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Flickering Reality": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Scintillating Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll one D6, then you can spend one Flux token to re-roll the result: until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, on an unmodified Hit roll (after any re-roll) of that result, the attack sequence ends, even if the original Hit roll would have been a Critical Hit.\n\n**Example**: *If you roll a 2 and choose to spend one Flux token to re-roll the result, and the re-roll is a 6, then until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, on an unmodified Hit roll of 6 the attack sequence ends, that attack fails to hit and no Critical Hit effects (e.g. Lethal Hits) are resolved.*"
      },
      "Stratagem§Foetid Resurgence": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Plague Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** unit from your army that is on the battlefield.\n\n**EFFECT:** Return up to 1 **destroyed** model to your unit (excluding **CHARACTER** models) or up to D3 **destroyed** models instead (excluding **CHARACTER** models) if your unit is a **BATTLELINE** unit, with their full wounds remaining. If your unit is a **MONSTER** unit, one model in your unit regains up to D3+1 lost wounds instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fool’s Flight": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Blood Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly unengaged **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit that is within 6\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Declare a charge with your unit. When selecting **charge targets**, you can only select enemy units that made a **fall-back move** this phase and are within the **maximum distance**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Gore-Hungry Onslaught": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Blood Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a move, it can move through terrain features."
      },
      "Stratagem§Impossible Eclipse": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Scintillating Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH MONSTER** unit from your army that is on the battlefield.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select No Man’s Land or your opponent’s deployment zone, or spend one Flux token and select both. Until the end of the phase, the selected areas of the battlefield are within your army’s Shadow of Chaos."
      },
      "Stratagem§Murkshadows": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Plague Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE INFANTRY** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Normal move, add 5\" to the Move characteristic of models in your unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Overwhelming Excess": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Legion of Excess"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Phantasmal Longing": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Legion of Excess"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a move, it can move through terrain features."
      },
      "Stratagem§Plague of Woes": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Plague Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Command phase, before selecting any targets for the Melancholic Miasma Detachment rule.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, after an enemy unit takes a Battle-shock test as a result of the Melancholic Miasma Detachment rule, select one other enemy unit within 9\" of your unit; that enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pyrogenesis": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Scintillating Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight that phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, add 2 to the Strength characteristic of weapons equipped by models in your unit, or spend one Flux token and add 3 to the Strength characteristic of those weapons and improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of those weapons by 1 instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Rot and Renewal": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Plague Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a move, it can move through terrain features."
      },
      "Stratagem§Seeping Virulence": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Plague Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Sensory Excruciation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Legion of Excess"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH MONSTER** unit from your army that is on the battlefield.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each unit on the battlefield that is within your army’s Shadow of Chaos must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test if they are Below Half-strength.\n\n**Designer’s Note**: *This Stratagem forces all friendly and enemy units alike within your army’s Shadow of Chaos to take a Battle-shock test. This can allow a Chaos Daemons player to heal units from their army through the Daemonic Manifestation army rule, at the risk of causing some of their own units to become Battle-shocked.*"
      },
      "Stratagem§Shade Path": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Shadow Legion"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent's Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **SHADOW LEGION** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one visible enemy unit within 12\" of your unit. When that enemy unit declares a charge, that enemy unit has -1 to charge rolls. If your unit has **Nurgle**, that enemy unit must make a battle-shock roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Sheathed In Brass": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Blood Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a Save characteristic of 3+."
      },
      "Stratagem§Skulls Beget Blood": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Blood Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE INFANTRY** or **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE MOUNTED** unit from your army (excluding units that Fell Back this turn) that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit that is not within Engagement Range of one or more units from your army and is within 8\" of and visible to your unit. Roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Stratagem§Spiteful Demise": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Shadow Legion"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a **SHADOW LEGION** unit from your army is destroyed, before removing the last model in that unit from the battlefield and before rolling any dice for the Deadly Demise ability.\n\n**TARGET:** That **SHADOW LEGION** unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll one D6 for each enemy unit that is within Engagement Range of the last model in your unit, adding 2 to the result if your unit has the **SLAANESH** keyword: on a 4-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6+, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Realm of Chaos": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Daemonic Incursion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s turn.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** units from your army that are within your army’s Shadow of Chaos, or one other **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** • Place your unit in **strategic reserves**.\n• Your unit must make an **ingress move** in your next Movement phase (including in your first turn).\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot target units that are within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units with this Stratagem."
      },
      "Stratagem§Warp Surge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Daemonic Incursion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit from your army that is within your army’s Shadow of Chaos.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wrath Undeniable": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Blood Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed by a melee attack, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, do not remove the destroyed model from play; it can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
